ints in $\\mathbb R^3$ to values in $\\mathbb R$ (not $\\mathbb R^3$).\n\n- The function $C(x,y,z)$ is *not* a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3.$ It assigns points in $\\mathbb R^3$ to vectors in $\\mathbb R^2$ (not $\\mathbb R^3$).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the listed.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186546165 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb34fdb0-198e-507d-a944-9be782b4cfeb" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Vector Fields on Three-Dimensions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0dc2c1c6-f517-5473-9ca5-04d21d21cd5b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546137} {:answer/id #uuid "bcceab6a-5bd6-5b65-a321-de13d20e78e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546206}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0dc2c1c6-f517-5473-9ca5-04d21d21cd5b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546137} :answer-field/id #uuid "06cf4d3a-73bb-584b-a17d-2e0b0b554feb" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546136} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a7db32a4-22e5-5794-876f-8afa0c57c8cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546195} {:answer/id #uuid "c347afe8-349c-510e-8f0d-e8c11d8d2e8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546212}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c347afe8-349c-510e-8f0d-e8c11d8d2e8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546212} :answer-field/id #uuid "4217d8cc-3600-5743-ba61-850eb566704b" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546154} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "405c604b-d3b1-5dc7-b53e-7dd8af5b6152" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type